[{"client_msg_id":"abec7a10-dde3-4fc3-b9df-d9023d1afc88","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"こうなると `typeof` がそろそろ必要になりそう。","ts":"1630656742.058600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KMyW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c45aba8c-5c43-4ad5-aad8-6a8e93cf7c83","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"`type int string` が許されてるから `T[int]` も通さんと駄目か。","ts":"1630656669.058300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zQlzp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"03bea1c5-e8c3-4ef5-b938-747225d05ddd","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"予約語かそうでないのかの違い","ts":"1630656301.057700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9CPUK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7577d8cd-5f79-4e26-be19-92f5a8bb38a9","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"ですです。","ts":"1630656298.057500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RDX5u"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6762001c-9330-44e1-8fac-06578215aa24","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"type int string とやるのと同じで問題はなさそう","ts":"1630656292.057200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5wLOT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4e87fee7-dcc8-411a-8793-aba8a06f53c9","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"Go ってパッケージスコープなので\n```package main\n\nimport \"fmt\"\n\ntype T[P any] struct{}\n\nfunc (T[Q]) m() {\n\tvar x Q\n\tfmt.Printf(\"x is a %T\\n\", x)\n}\n\nfunc main() {\n\tvar r T[string]\n\tr.m()\n}```\nこのソースで、別の go ファイルで `type Q int` ってやっちゃうと知らずに実装が変わるので。","ts":"1630656286.057000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KBw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3e16c1e7-44f6-46ed-b64b-0161773facb6","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"コンパイルエラーでいいんじゃないですかね。未定義より。","ts":"1630656214.055400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QL6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4adeaaa7-ba5c-43ec-aa46-4f30bdf37c94","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"`r.m()` が未定義です って言われるほうが、一般的な気がしますね","ts":"1630656078.054200","thread_ts":"1630655781.053200","subtype":"thread_broadcast","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ex6Em"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"5e15d06d-07ff-4c28-958e-aff1f02609b9","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"これが通るのねw \u003chttps://go2goplay.golang.org/p/ijohyL6LJN_E\u003e","ts":"1630655781.053200","thread_ts":"1630655781.053200","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"czW"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"063233fe-a745-42e1-9591-babbbcd4ace0","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"さすがに C++ では通らんか\n```#include \u0026lt;iostream\u0026gt;\n#include \u0026lt;string\u0026gt;\n\ntemplate\u0026lt;typename int\u0026gt;\nint foo() {\n  return int{};\n}\n\nint main() {\n  std::cout \u0026lt;\u0026lt; foo\u0026lt;std::string\u0026gt;() \u0026lt;\u0026lt; std::endl;\n  return 0;\n}```","ts":"1630655934.053600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pyNX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5e15d06d-07ff-4c28-958e-aff1f02609b9","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"これが通るのねw \u003chttps://go2goplay.golang.org/p/ijohyL6LJN_E\u003e","ts":"1630655781.053200","thread_ts":"1630655781.053200","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"czW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4b366aec-350b-4277-8a96-20e934d31d52","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"そんでもって型名の宣言の方が優先されるので","ts":"1630655762.052900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rdp"}]},{"client_msg_id":